@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_HeidiIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_HeidiIntro::
	.string "I'm having a picnic in the desert.\p"
	.string "You can always find a TRAINER,\n"
	.string "so I can enjoy a battle here, too!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_HeidiDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_HeidiDefeat::
	.string "Ohhh! You're mean!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_HeidiPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_HeidiPostBattle::
	.string "When you're battling in a sandstorm,\n"
	.string "watch out for your POKéMON's HP.\p"
	.string "It can faint if you don't keep\n"
	.string "an eye on it!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_ToughToKeepWinningUpTheRanks
Hoenn_Route111_Text_ToughToKeepWinningUpTheRanks::
	.string "If you don't raise your POKéMON some\n"
	.string "more, it could be tough to keep winning\l"
	.string "up through the ranks.\p"
	.string "I've heard the POKéMON LEAGUE's\n"
	.string "ELITE FOUR are far stronger than\l"
	.string "any GYM LEADER.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DrewIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DrewIntro::
	.string "Oh, hey! Those GO-GOGGLES suit you.\n"
	.string "But I think they look better on me.\p"
	.string "Let's decide who they look better on\n"
	.string "with a battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DrewDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DrewDefeat::
	.string "I couldn't see what was happening at\n"
	.string "my sides because of the GO-GOGGLES.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DrewPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DrewPostBattle::
	.string "The GO-GOGGLES make it possible to\n"
	.string "get through sandstorms.\l"
	.string "That makes me happy!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DustyIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DustyIntro::
	.string "For thirty years I have searched for\n"
	.string "ancient ruins!\l"
	.string "I am to be challenged?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DustyDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DustyDefeat::
	.string "While I have searched for ruins,\n"
	.string "I've not searched for strong POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DustyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DustyPostBattle::
	.string "For thirty years I have searched for\n"
	.string "ancient ruins!\p"
	.string "No, wait, was that forty years?\n"
	.string "Which was it now?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BeauIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BeauIntro::
	.string "Wearing these GO-GOGGLES makes me\n"
	.string "feel like a superhero.\l"
	.string "Right now, nobody can beat me!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BeauDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BeauDefeat::
	.string "I can't win on spirit alone…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BeauPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BeauPostBattle::
	.string "I'm going to be a real hero one day.\n"
	.string "I'm going to work harder to make me\l"
	.string "and my POKéMON stronger.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BeckyIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BeckyIntro::
	.string "I heard there are fossils to be found\n"
	.string "in the desert. Where could they be?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BeckyDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BeckyDefeat::
	.string "I came up short…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BeckyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BeckyPostBattle::
	.string "If they can find fossils in the desert,\n"
	.string "it must have been a sea before.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_IreneIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_IreneIntro::
	.string "I don't know where you're going,\n"
	.string "but would you like to battle?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_IreneDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_IreneDefeat::
	.string "Oh, you're disgustingly good!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_IrenePostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_IrenePostBattle::
	.string "I'm thinking that I should go to\n"
	.string "MT. CHIMNEY, but the view around\l"
	.string "here is very nice, too.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_TravisIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TravisIntro::
	.string "I'm full of pep!\n"
	.string "And my POKéMON is peppy, too!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_TravisDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TravisDefeat::
	.string "My POKéMON lost its pep…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_TravisPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TravisPostBattle::
	.string "When I see a TRAINER with a lot of pep,\n"
	.string "I can't help looking.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DaisukeIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DaisukeIntro::
	.string "To train myself, I challenge all\n"
	.string "whom I meet!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DaisukeDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DaisukeDefeat::
	.string "Uncle! I give up!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_DaisukePostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_DaisukePostBattle::
	.string "All I can do is keep training until\n"
	.string "I can defeat strong TRAINERS such\l"
	.string "as yourself.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BrookeIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BrookeIntro::
	.string "Oh, your POKéMON look like serious\n"
	.string "actors.\l"
	.string "I have to ask you for an engagement.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BrookeDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BrookeDefeat::
	.string "They didn't just look strong,\n"
	.string "they are strong!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BrookePostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BrookePostBattle::
	.string "I thought I was raising my POKéMON\n"
	.string "diligently, but, oh no, there is still\l"
	.string "much to be done.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_WiltonIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_WiltonIntro::
	.string "Show me how much you've toughened\n"
	.string "your POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_WiltonDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_WiltonDefeat::
	.string "I see, you've toughened them\n"
	.string "considerably.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_WiltonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_WiltonPostBattle::
	.string "POKéMON and TRAINERS learn much\n"
	.string "through battling.\p"
	.string "What's important is to never give up\n"
	.string "even if you lose.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_WinstrateFamilyDestroyedMe
Hoenn_Route111_Text_WinstrateFamilyDestroyedMe::
	.string "I challenged the WINSTRATE family,\n"
	.string "but four matches in a row is tough\l"
	.string "going… They destroyed me.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_TyronIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TyronIntro::
	.string "This is my favorite kind of POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_TyronDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TyronDefeat::
	.string "Wait!\n"
	.string "Did you get a good look at my POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_TyronPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TyronPostBattle::
	.string "When having a battle, I get a kick out\n"
	.string "of showing off my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I bet everyone feels that way when\n"
	.string "they enter a battle!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_CelinaIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_CelinaIntro::
	.string "Show me how to put a little excitement\n"
	.string "into my life.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_CelinaDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_CelinaDefeat::
	.string "Oh… My…\n"
	.string "That was too much excitement.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_CelinaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_CelinaPostBattle::
	.string "My pulse is still racing.\n"
	.string "You're one fabulous TRAINER.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BiancaIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BiancaIntro::
	.string "Did you come from MAUVILLE?\n"
	.string "Then you should be full of energy!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BiancaDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BiancaDefeat::
	.string "Ooh lala!\n"
	.string "That's a lot to take!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BiancaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BiancaPostBattle::
	.string "This road here…\n"
	.string "You have quite a ways to travel.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_HaydenIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_HaydenIntro::
	.string "When you're as famished as I am,\n"
	.string "there is no room for pity!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_HaydenDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_HaydenDefeat::
	.string "Groan…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_HaydenPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_HaydenPostBattle::
	.string "My stomach is grumbling!\n"
	.string "Maybe I can grill some BERRIES…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BryanIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BryanIntro::
	.string "How tough are you?\n"
	.string "We shall expose that secret!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BryanDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BryanDefeat::
	.string "Oh! Your strength!\n"
	.string "It is shrouded in mystery!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BryanPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BryanPostBattle::
	.string "This desert hoards mysteries in\n"
	.string "its shifting sands!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_CeliaIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_CeliaIntro::
	.string "I shouldn't have come to a place like\n"
	.string "this for a picnic!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_CeliaDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_CeliaDefeat::
	.string "Aww!\n"
	.string "I really shouldn't have come!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_CeliaPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_CeliaPostBattle::
	.string "In a sandstorm like this, I can't set\n"
	.string "the places for a picnic even with my\l"
	.string "GO-GOGGLES on…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BrandenIntro
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BrandenIntro::
	.string "I'll give you some of my sandwich\n"
	.string "if you'll lose.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BrandenDefeat
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BrandenDefeat::
	.string "Tch! I thought a sandwich would be\n"
	.string "enough of a bribe…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route111_Text_BrandenPostBattle
Hoenn_Route111_Text_BrandenPostBattle::
	.string "My SANDSHREW loves eating\n"
	.string "my sandwiches.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_ShouldBeMirageTowerAroundHere
Hoenn_Route111_Text_ShouldBeMirageTowerAroundHere::
	.string "There should be a tower made of sand\n"
	.string "around here somewhere.\p"
	.string "But for some reason, it can be seen\n"
	.string "sometimes, and sometimes not.\p"
	.string "That's why I call it the MIRAGE TOWER.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_WinstrateHouseSign
Hoenn_Route111_Text_WinstrateHouseSign::
	.string "“Our family's hearts beat as one!”\n"
	.string "THE WINSTRATE'S HOUSE$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_RouteSignMauville
Hoenn_Route111_Text_RouteSignMauville::
	.string "ROUTE 111\n"
	.string "{DOWN_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_RouteSign112
Hoenn_Route111_Text_RouteSign112::
	.string "ROUTE 111\n"
	.string "{LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 112$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_RouteSign113
Hoenn_Route111_Text_RouteSign113::
	.string "ROUTE 111\n"
	.string "{LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 113$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_OldLadysRestStopSign
Hoenn_Route111_Text_OldLadysRestStopSign::
	.string "OLD LADY'S REST STOP\n"
	.string "“Come in and rest your tired bones.”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_TrainerTipsSpAtkSpDef
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TrainerTipsSpAtkSpDef::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "One of the indicators of a POKéMON's\n"
	.string "powerfulness is SP. ATK. It stands for\l"
	.string "“SPECIAL ATTACK.”\p"
	.string "Likewise, SP. DEF stands for “SPECIAL\n"
	.string "DEFENSE.”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route111/scripts.inc: Route111_Text_TrainerHillSign
Hoenn_Route111_Text_TrainerHillSign::
	.string "{RIGHT_ARROW} TRAINER HILL ENTRANCE\p"
	.string "“Scale the heights, you hot-blooded\n"
	.string "TRAINERS!”$"
